description=HyperCameraMod 1.1.0-195 - M3/M9 Leica looks + Original Portrait software for Aurora (14 Ultra). LSPosed module for Xiaomi Camera 6.7. Stages M3/M9 LUTs, enables HAL engine gate. Includes APK auto-install as user app (grant root in KernelSU after install). Compatible with nomount/zeromount/mountify metamodules. No ChiX plugin.